# Authority to Recruit — chase the outstanding signatories, daily 06:00 UTC (08:00 SAST).
#
# CFO directive 2026-08-11. The five-signature instrument shipped with no
# notification at all: an authority was raised and sat there. On 11-Aug-2026 both
# records on prod (ARG-2026-0001 Kago Tshutlhedi, ATR-2026-0001 Bokang Bobby
# Mothibi) were still 0-of-5 signed for exactly that reason.
#
# Raising an authority now emails the signatories immediately (authority_views);
# this is the recurring half. --min-age-days 2 keeps it from doubling up on the
# raise email. Only PENDING authorities are chased, and only the signatories who
# still owe a decision.
#
# Deliberately 08:00 SAST, not the 07:05 consolidated-brief slot: this goes to the
# CEO, COO, both Human Capital signatories and the CFO, and must not be folded
# into a staff-wide digest — the authorities carry individual pay structures.
#
# Drop into /etc/cron.d/ (sudo cp + chmod 644). Times are UTC; SAST = UTC+2.
SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin

0 6 * * * root cd /opt/alpha-finance && /usr/bin/docker compose --env-file /etc/alpha-finance/.env exec -T backend python manage.py run_job authority-signature-reminders -- authority_signature_reminders --min-age-days 2 >> /var/log/alpha-finance/authority-signature-reminders.log 2>&1
